@startuml
'==== Title ====
title "As a User, I want to use a Web UI to create a private list of my publications, \n give it a name, set a genre and, eventually, share it." - SD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black
hidefootbox
autonumber

' ==== Actor and participants ====
actor User
participant ":Mitelovers" as System

User -> System : Show me what I can do here
activate System
System --> User : These are your available resources
deactivate System

User -> System : Show me my lists of items
activate System
System --> User : display lists of items
deactivate System

User -> System : publicly share my list
activate System
System --> User : for how many days?
deactivate System

User -> System : days
activate System
System --> User: Success!
deactivate System

@enduml